From 3722dfc2be6fd629f91737ef472b522545e8e3f7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: b1air <dimazzzzz342@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 10:49:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add dragging windows between workspaces in the overview

Pressed on a tiled window in one workspace's cell and let go in
another's, the window goes to that workspace, as `move container to
workspace` sends it, and the overview stays up to show it land. While
it is held a pane its size in the overview, in the indicator colour,
follows the cursor, and the workspace under it is the one outlined.

A click still goes to the workspace it is on, and beside them all
leaves; it is the release that does it now, so that a press can become
a drag. A press that moves less than a few pixels is a click. A window
that closes while held is let go.
